# Line endings, pinned. The two .sh tools run under bash inside WSL, and a CRLF there
# turns `set -uo pipefail\r` into an unrecognised option - a normal `git clone` on
# Windows must not be able to break them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.npz binary
*.pkl binary
*.zip binary
*.json text eol=lf
